# What the operator types on the console keyboard: "milliseconds text".
# pm2 asks how many squares; the operator answers. Then the operator switches
# off the machine of node 2 (kubectl gets the line: "k kill 2"), later asks
# for five replicas, and at the end for the report.
12000 pm2 12\n
40000 k kill 2\n
70000 k scale 5\n
110000 end\n
